# `power::Grid`

An immutable compiled network.

## Signature

```cpp
std::int64_t power::Grid::buses() const noexcept;
std::int64_t power::Grid::gens() const noexcept;
std::int64_t power::Grid::lines() const noexcept;
const std::vector<std::int64_t>& power::Grid::batch_shape() const noexcept;
double power::Grid::base_power() const noexcept;
const power::Base& power::Grid::base() const noexcept;
const pluss::Series& power::Grid::ybus() const noexcept;
```

## Construction

Accessors return counts, the base and the admittance matrices.

## Methods

| Method | What it does |
|---|---|
| [`buses`](Grid/buses.md) | The number of buses. |
| [`gens`](Grid/gens.md) | The number of generators. |
| [`lines`](Grid/lines.md) | The number of lines. |
| [`batch_shape`](Grid/batch_shape.md) | The leading scenario axes shared by all values. |
| [`base_power`](Grid/base_power.md) | The three-phase apparent-power base in volt-amperes. |
| [`base`](Grid/base.md) | The per-unit base: apparent power and line-to-line voltage. |
| [`dtype`](Grid/dtype.md) | The floating dtype of the stored values. |
| [`platform`](Grid/platform.md) | The device the stored values live on. |
| [`ybus`](Grid/ybus.md) | The complex bus admittance matrix. |
| [`yfrom`](Grid/yfrom.md) | The complex from-end line admittance matrix. |
| [`yto`](Grid/yto.md) | The complex to-end line admittance matrix. |

## Changelog

- **0.1**: initial documented surface.

